   99999. Delete the line and compare: nothing may differ.
3. Write `GIVE NEW 3 1 <something>` with no `FORM 3` anywhere in that hex. Same untouched row, and
   the warning must read exactly `no FORM in this hex creates NEW 3, so this order does nothing`.
4. Add `FORM 3` / `END` to any of your units in that same hex. The warning must go, and the goods
   must move to the new unit's row.
5. On a unit holding goods the market wants, write `GIVE <the foreign unit> ALL <those goods>` and
