| Site (as it stands on the `ah-z73s.3` branch) | Becomes |
|---|---|
| `Ordered { … men_joined: i64 }` | `arrivals: Arrivals` |
| both `Hex::read` construction sites, `men_joined: 0` | `arrivals: Arrivals::default()` |
| `Working { … men_arrived: i64 }` | `men_given: i64, men_taken: i64` |
