## Known traps

- `ah-9hp7.1` has not landed yet. Do not guess its field names or duplicate its scraper work; read its final merged contract before starting. Its optional `skill_limits` means an old cached ruleset remains valid, so this bead must take the chosen global-only fallback rather than unwrap it.
