**One new type rung.** The tag, the gate and both kinds of chip are 9.5px, and a component may not
say so directly: `theme.test.ts`'s *sets no pane type in absolute pixels* fails any non-test source
matching `text-\[[\d.]+px\]` or `fontSize: "…px"`. Add a fourth rung to the pane scale in `@theme`,
directly above `--text-pane-sm`:

```css
