    expect(html).toMatch(/data-testid="magic-tree-chip-CRRI-INVI"[^>]*class="[^"]*ml-auto/);
  });
```

`ROW_STYLE`, `Gate`'s new `meta` prop and the `text-select` name land here. **Two existing
assertions must be updated in the same increment**, because the locked row no longer carries
`text-ink-dim` on its own element — see *Known traps*.

**4 — the cards are 21rem wide, and the browser agrees the rows are single lines.**
Opens with a Playwright assertion in `tests/smoke/magic-standing.spec.ts`, inside the existing
`"the tree opens tinted for the selected mage and says where he stands"` test, after the standing
assertions:

