### Where state lives

Nowhere new. `source` is the dock's own `useState` (`:209`); the selected hex, unit, `pickEpoch`
and `mapView` all live in `workspaceStore`, and `goToUnit` is the only thing that writes them here.
`travelTo` derives from `source` and calls a prop — it owns nothing, invalidates nothing, and adds
no render.

### Which layer

The rule is a pure function in `packages/shared/src/workspace/unitSource.ts`; the wiring is three
call sites in the component beside it. Nothing reaches the Rust core, `core-client` or a shell.

