From `packages/shared/src/armies.ts`: `snapshotOf`, `newArmy`, `renameArmy`, `withMember`,
`withoutMember`, `unitsByIdIn(parsed): Map<string, ReportUnit>`, `refreshedAgainst`,
`memberIsStale(member, currentTurn): boolean` (its body is `member.seenTurn < currentTurn`), and
`sortArmies`.

From `packages/shared/src/armiesStore.ts`, `useArmiesStore`, whose state is
`{ gameId: string | null; status: "idle" | "loading" | "ready" | "error"; armies: ArmyRecord[] }`
and whose actions this bead calls:

```ts
create:     (client, game, name: string, now: string) => Promise<ArmyRecord>;
rename:     (client, game, armyId: string, name: string, now: string) => Promise<void>;
remove:     (client, game, armyId: string) => Promise<void>;
addUnit:    (client, game, armyId: string, unit: ReportUnit, turn: number, now: string) => Promise<void>;
