### Where state lives

| State | Owner | Persisted? |
|---|---|---|
| The chosen source | `UnitTableDock` local `useState` | **No** — T2. Reopening the app, and opening another game, both land on `This hex`. |
| Sort, filter | `UnitTableDock` local state, as today | No, as today |
| Column widths and order | `useWorkspaceStore`, as today | Yes, as today — and **unchanged**, because `UNIT_COLUMNS` does not move |
| Rail editing (naming, renaming, confirming a delete) | `UnitTableDock`, a `useReducer` over `railEditState.reduce` — shared by the rail, the strip and the popover | No |
| The Armies themselves | `useArmiesStore` (`ah-1mpx.1`) | No — it is a cache; storage is the truth |
| The failure message | `AppShell`'s `status` | No |

