```bash
pnpm run check:fast
```

Lint, typecheck (including `cargo check --workspace`), every vitest suite, `pnpm run test:tooling`,
`cargo test --workspace`, `pnpm run check:generated`, `cargo fmt --check`, and
`cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`. It runs all six legs even after one fails,
so read the whole summary.

This bead is a browser change, so the smoke suites matter more than usual and are worth running
